			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@damianwalsh\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>damianwalsh</span></a></span> I didn’t apply filmstrips and comparisons to the Built Awesome category for resource (file size) reasons on the site. I think it’s possible to readd it back in at some point but I just want to take care there as this site does pressure GitHub’s free tier 😅</p>",
