			},
			"date": "2026-09-22T15:47:53.182Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@McNeely\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>McNeely</span></a></span> ah, I don’t think I’m trying to make that point. The point I am trying to make here is that we aren’t at the level of automation that will craft good quality (and good quality is still important)</p><p>but to your point, I don’t know! It doesn’t seem like that could be measurable (if I understand you correctly)</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
		{
			"id": "117315484665918918",
			"parentId": "117315474108102456",
			"url": "https://indieweb.social/@McNeely/117315484630475957",
