			},
			"date": "2026-09-22T15:50:33.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> totally makes sense. One of my thoughts is that we will never see *any* meaningful movement here as long as the industry standard practice is to stuff homepages full of trackers. So in a sense I'm not even sure this is a \"tools\" problem.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
