			"date": "2026-09-22T15:59:43.274Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://indieweb.social/@McNeely\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>McNeely</span></a></span> I’ve heard that question before and I’ve thought about it a lot. But this is the relationship that automation has with quality that I’m trying to get folks to look at more closely! My take is that some tools have a pit of success and some have a pit of failure and a good dev can make a bad tool fast but the real impact comes from defaults!</p>",
